=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Rasdinice} to start the mission.
* Talk to the {p:Gate Sentry} in either {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)} or {z:Xarcabard (S)}.
* The {p:Gate Sentry} hands you a package and applies the effects of Silence, Amnesia, and Gravity
* Talk to the NPC at the stronghold and receive {p:Experience Points}.
* Report back to {n:Rasdinice} to complete mission and receive {p:Allied Notes}.

=2 Notes
* Successful completion will increase Resources in the zone by 3.
* The reward for completion is the same regardless of area.
* Time Limit: 30 minutes.
* There seems to be a minimum time limit. If you are lucky about placement of the Tauri and Ahriman, you can get to the outpost quickly and will not be able to turn over the supplies for several minutes. This may or may not be intentional, but if the NPC will not accept the supplies, wait a few minutes and try again.

=2 Campaign Areas
{z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)}:
* {p:Gate Sentry} located at (F-6) near the zone to {z:Xarcabard (S)}.
* Stronghold located at (I-8), talk to {n:Disserond, R.K.}.

{z:Xarcabard (S)}:
* {p:Gate Sentry} located at (J-9) near the zone to {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)}.
* Stronghold located at (H-8), talk to {n:Estaud, R.K.}.

=2 Game Description
\**Objective:** A shipment of volatile magicked supplies needed for the reinforcement of our frontline defenses has reached a Kingdom checkpoint, where it awaits a reliable escort. Accompany the Knights of the Iron Ram to see the vital delivery safely to its destination.{br} **Unit Requirement:** 1 member
